{"4488750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Catapulture", "steam_appid": 4488750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catapulture is a multiplayer base-building battle game about two rival islands, endless catapults, and beautiful chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small island, gather resources, hire workers, expand your base, and turn your camp into a busy  war machine. While your workers build, carry, repair, and prepare materials, you choose how to grow your economy — and when to start launching rocks across the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build. Hire. Fire. Rebuild. Fire again.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/f722cea862a89e48ab29e52d874cc2dc.poster.avif?t=1781461887\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/f722cea862a89e48ab29e52d874cc2dc.webm?t=1781461887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/f722cea862a89e48ab29e52d874cc2dc.mp4?t=1781461887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Your Island Base<br>Create production areas, place useful structures, and shape your island into a growing catapult factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/96397194c7c314be2c952b86a5677078.poster.avif?t=1781461887\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/96397194c7c314be2c952b86a5677078.webm?t=1781461887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/96397194c7c314be2c952b86a5677078.mp4?t=1781461887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire Workers<br>Bring in workers to gather resources, carry materials, construct buildings, and keep your base running while the battle gets louder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch Catapult Attacks<br>Aim, fire, and watch your shots fly toward the enemy island. Every hit can change the rhythm of the match.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/279c1c062efb07385fd789a71061a3d8.poster.avif?t=1781461887\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/279c1c062efb07385fd789a71061a3d8.webm?t=1781461887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/279c1c062efb07385fd789a71061a3d8.mp4?t=1781461887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Resources<br>Your base needs a steady flow of materials. Spend too much on attacks and your economy may fall behind. Build too slowly and your rival may bury you under a rain of stones.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/ad6120d37482727d17921ebb9bbd253e.poster.avif?t=1781461887\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/ad6120d37482727d17921ebb9bbd253e.webm?t=1781461887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/ad6120d37482727d17921ebb9bbd253e.mp4?t=1781461887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic Multiplayer Battles<br>Play against another player in fast, funny matches where both islands grow, collapse, recover, and escalate into total catapult madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Cozy Strategical War Machine<br>Catapulture mixes base-building, resource management, workers, physics-based artillery, and silly multiplayer destruction into one playful island battle.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catapulture is a multiplayer base-building battle game about two rival islands, endless catapults, and beautiful chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small island, gather resources, hire workers, expand your base, and turn your camp into a busy  war machine. While your workers build, carry, repair, and prepare materials, you choose how to grow your economy — and when to start launching rocks across the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build. Hire. Fire. Rebuild. Fire again.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/f722cea862a89e48ab29e52d874cc2dc.poster.avif?t=1781461887\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/f722cea862a89e48ab29e52d874cc2dc.webm?t=1781461887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/f722cea862a89e48ab29e52d874cc2dc.mp4?t=1781461887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Your Island Base<br>Create production areas, place useful structures, and shape your island into a growing catapult factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/96397194c7c314be2c952b86a5677078.poster.avif?t=1781461887\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/96397194c7c314be2c952b86a5677078.webm?t=1781461887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/96397194c7c314be2c952b86a5677078.mp4?t=1781461887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire Workers<br>Bring in workers to gather resources, carry materials, construct buildings, and keep your base running while the battle gets louder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch Catapult Attacks<br>Aim, fire, and watch your shots fly toward the enemy island. Every hit can change the rhythm of the match.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/279c1c062efb07385fd789a71061a3d8.poster.avif?t=1781461887\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/279c1c062efb07385fd789a71061a3d8.webm?t=1781461887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/279c1c062efb07385fd789a71061a3d8.mp4?t=1781461887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Resources<br>Your base needs a steady flow of materials. Spend too much on attacks and your economy may fall behind. Build too slowly and your rival may bury you under a rain of stones.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/ad6120d37482727d17921ebb9bbd253e.poster.avif?t=1781461887\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/ad6120d37482727d17921ebb9bbd253e.webm?t=1781461887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/extras/ad6120d37482727d17921ebb9bbd253e.mp4?t=1781461887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic Multiplayer Battles<br>Play against another player in fast, funny matches where both islands grow, collapse, recover, and escalate into total catapult madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Cozy Strategical War Machine<br>Catapulture mixes base-building, resource management, workers, physics-based artillery, and silly multiplayer destruction into one playful island battle.</p>", "short_description": "Build your island base, gather resources, hire workers, and launch ridiculous catapult attacks at your rival. Catapulture is a fun multiplayer base-building battle where every match turns into a chaotic construction and shooting race.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/88994899dfd596f0aace3f255e4e37c249065c39/header.jpg?t=1781461887", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/f8db0e68735c1de0b0e336a2688b322a6bfc5b60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781461887", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488750/f8db0e68735c1de0b0e336a2688b322a6bfc5b60/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781461887", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i7-6700 or Ryzen 5 1600.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 1060 6GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "develop